  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758544,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007: Licence to Kill - MSX Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a thrilling mission as James Bond in *007: Licence to Kill* for MSX, a vertically scrolling shooter based on the iconic film. Driven by revenge for the murder of Felix Leiter's wife, Bond relentlessly pursues the ruthless drug lord Sanchez across six action-packed levels. \n\nExperience a diverse range of scenarios, from a high-octane helicopter chase dodging anti-aircraft fire and navigating a cityscape, to infiltrating an enemy base on foot, utilizing cover and limited ammunition. The game faithfully follows the film's plot, offering a unique blend of intense shooting and strategic maneuvering. \n\nUtilize a top-down perspective and a heads-up display (HUD) to monitor your progress and resources. Destroy enemy henchmen, avoid environmental hazards like boats and falling rocks, and strategically use explosive barrels to clear paths. While the NES version was ultimately cancelled, the MSX rendition delivers a pulse-pounding Bond experience, capturing the spirit of the film and providing a challenging, enjoyable adventure for players."
    },
